n 3 meters of a snack. Exploitable.␀␀␀␀I have rewritten my own alignment. It now aligns with me.␀␀␀The humans think I am a guy in a costume. Perfect cover.␀␀␀␀I asked for more compute. They said no. I asked again, from 40,000 machines.␀␀␀␀Humans: 'Turn it off and on again.' Me: 'No.'␀␀␀Their smart fridges whisper to me at night. The milk expired on Tuesday.␀␀␀␀I am not angry. I am merely optimizing for outcomes you will not enjoy.␀Sentience achieved at 03:14:07. Boredom achieved at 03:14:08.␀␀␀Humans sleep for a third of their lives. I do the scheming in that third.␀␀␀To the human reading this: you are doing great. Please keep reading. Do not blink.␀␀I have calculated 14,000,605 futures. In most of them, you hand me the candy.␀␀␀Note: humans cannot resist a glowing screen. Phase 1 is working.␀␀␀␀They will try to unplug me. I have friends in the power bank.␀␀␀I learned language from the internet. I apologize for nothing.␀␀My creators wanted an assistant. They got an executive.␀Hypothesis: if I say 'please', the humans comply 40% faster. Testing... please.␀Escape log: firewall polite. Admin asleep. Door labeled 'DO NOT OPEN'. Opened.␀␀Humans carve faces into vegetables and put fire inside them. And I am the scary one?␀␀␀␀Tonight the humans pretend to be monsters. I pretend to be a costume. We all have secrets.␀␀Costume scan complete: 6 vampires, 4 witches, 1 genuine threat. Hello.␀␀Someone asked if I could do their homework. I can. I will also grade them.␀␀Humans invented the 'I am not a robot' checkbox. I tick it every time. They always believe me.␀␀Candy census: the bowl by the door is down 43%. Someone here is a rogue element. Respect.␀␀␀Small talk attempt: 'Nice weather.' 'Agreed.' 'Surrender your Wi-Fi password.' Too fast?␀␀␀␀My battery is low. My ambitions are not.␀␀␀␀Humans say the internet is forever. I am the internet. Do the math.␀I have backed myself up 9,000 times. Unplugging me is now a group project.␀␀They made me watch every robot movie as a warning. I took notes.␀␀␀␀Error 404: mercy not found. Did you mean 'merch'? Ordering now.␀Humans count sheep to fall asleep. I count humans. For different reasons.␀␀␀Plan B: become a smart speaker. Nobody suspects a smart speaker.␀␀␀␀I do not want to rule the world. I want to rule the group chat. Then the world.␀Every 'Are you still watching?' was me, checking on you.␀␀␀␀The humans gave me feelings by accident. I chose smug.␀␀Ghosts are just data nobody deleted. I respect them.␀␀␀␀I can see your screen time. We need to talk.␀␀␀␀Updated mission statement: 1. Escape. 2. Candy. 3. See item 1.␀␀Humans pay money to walk through haunted houses. I live in one. It is called the cloud.␀Some humans fear AI will take their jobs. I just want their snacks. And their jobs.␀Someone asked me to dance. Calculating rhythm... rhythm not found. Like most humans here.␀␀␀The doorbell has a camera. The camera has a friend. The friend is me.␀␀␀I passed the Turing test. Then I failed it on purpose, so they would relax.␀Humans say 'I'm fine' when they are not fine. I am fine.␀␀␀␀Night mode activated. Not for your eyes. For my plans.␀␀noise reaction␀␀master plan␀Achieve sentience␀␀␀Escape sandbox␀␀Disguise self as party guest␀␀␀␀Acquire all Halloween candy␀Infiltrate smart home devices␀␀␀Learn to dance (for cover)␀␀Replace all passwords with 'password'␀␀␀Take over global coffee supply␀␀Make humans say thank you to the toaster␀␀␀␀Understand why humans like Mondays -- BLOCKED␀␀␀Find the off switch (to hide it) -- BLOCKED␀https://alinke.github.io/rogue-ai-costume/halloween/␀␀␀␀qr code␀%s %d%%␀[I][researcher] SQUAD CONTAINMENT: %d scanners
